input.content:
:root {
  --bg: #050809;
  --bg-2: #070d0f;
  --panel: rgba(12, 20, 22, 0.88);
  --panel-solid: #0c1416;
  --panel-2: #0f1a1d;
  --line: #1a2b2e;
  --line-2: #243a3e;
  --text: #e9f4f1;
  --muted: #8aa3a0;
  --dim: #5c7371;
  --lime: #b7ff3c;
  --lime-dim: #8fd41f;
  --lime-soft: rgba(183, 255, 60, 0.11);
  --cyan: #45e6ff;
  --cyan-soft: rgba(69, 230, 255, 0.1);
  --red: #ff6478;
  --amber: #ffc857;
  --radius: 16px;
  --radius-sm: 10px;
  --sans: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
  --mono: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, "SF Mono", Menlo, Consolas, "Liberation Mono", monospace;
  --shadow: 0 24px 60px -32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; }

html { color-scheme: dark; scroll-behavior: smooth; }

body {
  margin: 0;
  min-height: 100vh;
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--text);
  font-family: var(--sans);
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.5;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  overflow-x: hidden;
}

button, input { font: inherit; }
button { color: inherit; }

::selection { background: rgba(183, 255, 60, 0.28); color: #fff; }

.backdrop {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  z-index: -1;
  overflow: hidden;
  background:
    radial-gradient(1200px 600px at 18% -10%, rgba(183, 255, 60, 0.07), transparent 60%),
    radial-gradient(900px 500px at 92% 8%, rgba(69, 230, 255, 0.05), transparent 60%),
    linear-gradient(180deg, #060b0c 0%, #040708 100%);
}

.backdrop-grid {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background-image:
    linear-gradient(rgba(120, 170, 165, 0.055) 1px, transparent 1px),
    linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(120, 170, 165, 0.055) 1px, transparent 1px);
  background-size: 52px 52px;
  mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 85% 70% at 50% 0%, #000 20%, transparent 78%);
}

.glow { position: absolute; border-radius: 50%; filter: blur(100px); opacity: 0.35; }
.glow-a { width: 460px; height: 460px; left: -160px; top: 240px; background: rgba(183, 255, 60, 0.12); }
.glow-b { width: 520px; height: 520px; right: -200px; bottom: -120px; background: rgba(69, 230, 255, 0.1); }

.shell {
  width: min(1420px, calc(100% - 48px));
  margin: 0 auto;
}

/* ---------- top bar ---------- */

.topbar {
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 40;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(36, 58, 62, 0.65);
  background: rgba(5, 9, 10, 0.78);
  backdrop-filter: blur(16px) saturate(1.4);
}

.topbar-inner {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 20px;
  height: 68px;
}

.brand {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  color: var(--text);
  text-decoration: none;
}

.brand-mark {
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  width: 38px;
  height: 38px;
  color: var(--lime);
  border: 1px solid rgba(183, 255, 60, 0.28);
  border-radius: 11px;
  background: linear-gradient(155deg, rgba(183, 255, 60, 0.14), rgba(183, 255, 60, 0.02));
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 18px rgba(183, 255, 60, 0.08), 0 0 26px rgba(183, 255, 60, 0.07);
}
.brand-mark svg { width: 25px; height: 25px; }

.brand-copy { display: flex; flex-direction: column; line-height: 1.05; }
.brand-copy strong { font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; font-weight: 700; }
.brand-copy small { color: var(--dim); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 9.5px; letter-spacing: 0.09em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 5px; }

.topbar-right { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }

.pill {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  padding: 7px 12px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.pill-safe {
  color: var(--lime);
  border: 1px solid rgba(183, 255, 60, 0.24);
  background: rgba(183, 255, 60, 0.06);
}

.dot {
  width: 6px;
  height: 6px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: currentColor;
  box-shadow: 0 0 9px currentColor;
  animation: blink 2.4s ease-in-out infinite;
}

@keyframes blink {
  0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
  50% { opacity: 0.35; }
}

/* ---------- buttons ---------- */

.btn {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 8px;
  height: 40px;
  padding: 0 16px;
  border-radius: 10px;
  border: 1px solid transparent;
  background: transparent;
  font-weight: 600;
  font-size: 12.5px;
  letter-spacing: 0.015em;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background 160ms ease, border-color 160ms ease, color 160ms ease, transform 120ms ease, box-shadow 160ms ease;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.btn:active { transform: translateY(1px); }
.btn svg { width: 15px; height: 15px; flex: none; }
.btn:disabled { opacity: 0.42; cursor: not-allowed; }
.btn:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--cyan); outline-offset: 2px; }

.btn-primary {
  color: #101a03;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #c8ff63 0%, var(--lime) 100%);
  border-color: rgba(183, 255, 60, 0.6);
  box-shadow: 0 10px 28px -12px rgba(183, 255, 60, 0.55), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
}
.btn-primary:hover { background: #c6ff5c; box-shadow: 0 14px 32px -10px rgba(183, 255, 60, 0.7), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4); }

.btn-outline {
  border-color: var(--line-2);
  background: rgba(16, 27, 29, 0.7);
  color: var(--text);
}
.btn-outline:hover { border-color: #35565a; background: #122124; }

.btn-ghost { color: var(--muted); border-color: transparent; }
.btn-ghost:hover { color: var(--text); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.045); }

.btn-sm { height: 34px; padding: 0 12px; font-size: 11.5px; border-radius: 9px; }
.btn-icon { width: 40px; padding: 0; flex: none; }
.btn-sm.btn-icon { width: 34px; }

.text-btn {
  padding: 0;
  border: 0;
  background: none;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 10.5px;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  cursor: pointer;
}
.text-btn:hover { color: var(--lime); }
.text-btn:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--cyan); outline-offset: 3px; border-radius: 3px; }

/* ---------- notice ---------- */

main { padding: 22px 0 40px; }

.notice {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 14px;
  padding: 13px 16px;
  margin-bottom: 18px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 200, 87, 0.22);
  border-left: 3px solid var(--amber);
  border-radius: 12px;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 200, 87, 0.075), rgba(255, 200, 87, 0.02));
}

.notice-icon {
  flex: none;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  width: 28px;
  height: 28px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 200, 87, 0.4);
  color: var(--amber);
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 13px;
}

.notice-copy { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
.notice-copy strong { display: block; color: #ffe3a1; font-size: 12.5px; letter-spacing: 0.01em; }
.notice-copy p { margin: 2px 0 0; color: #b7a682; font-size: 12px; }

/* ---------- layout ---------- */

.dashboard {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 390px minmax(0, 1fr);
  gap: 18px;
  align-items: start;
}

.side, .maincol { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; min-width: 0; }

.card {
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  background:
    linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(17, 28, 30, 0.92), rgba(9, 15, 17, 0.94));
  box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.card::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0 0 auto;
  height: 1px;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(183, 255, 60, 0.22), transparent);
  opacity: 0.7;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.card-head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 14px;
  padding: 16px 18px 13px;
}

.card-head h2 {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.13em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: #c5d9d5;
}

.tag {
  padding: 3px 8px;
  border-radius: 5px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line-2);
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.025);
  color: var(--dim);
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 9.5px;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}
.tag.is-live { color: var(--lime); border-color: rgba(183, 255, 60, 0.3); background: var(--lime-soft); }
.tag.is-done { color: var(--cyan); border-color: rgba(69, 230, 255, 0.3); background: var(--cyan-soft); }
.tag.is-paused { color: var(--amber); border-color: rgba(255, 200, 87, 0.3); background: rgba(255, 200, 87, 0.08); }

.count {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 10px;
  color: var(--dim);
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

/* ---------- controls ---------- */

.controls { padding-bottom: 15px; }
.controls .card-head { padding-bottom: 15px; }

.field { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 7px; padding: 0 18px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
.field-label {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 9.5px;
  letter-spacing: 0.11em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--muted);
}
.field-row { display: flex; gap: 8px; }
.field-row input { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }

.field input[type="url"],
.field input[type="number"] {
  width: 100%;
  height: 40px;
  padding: 0 12px;
  border-radius: 9px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line-2);
  background: #081012;
  color: var(--text);
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 11.5px;
  outline: none;
  transition: border-color 150ms ease, box-shadow 150ms ease, background 150ms ease;
}
.field input[type="url"]::placeholder { color: #415553; }
.field input[type="url"]:focus,
.field input[type="number"]:focus {
  border-color: rgba(183, 255, 60, 0.45);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(183, 255, 60, 0.08);
  background: #0a1315;
}
.field input.is-invalid { border-color: rgba(255, 100, 120, 0.7); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(255, 100, 120, 0.08); }

.field-hint { font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--dim); }
.field-hint.is-error { color: var(--red); }

.field-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0; }
.field-grid .field { padding-right: 0; }
.field-grid .field:first-child { padding-right: 7px; }
.field-grid .field:last-child { padding-left: 7px; }

.input-prefix { position: relative; }
.input-prefix > span {
  position: absolute;
  left: 12px;
  top: 50%;
  transform: translateY(-50%);
  color: var(--dim);
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 12px;
  pointer-events: none;
}
.input-prefix input { padding-left: 25px !important; }

.range-field { padding: 0 18px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
.range-head { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 9px; }
.range-value {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  color: var(--lime);
  padding: 2px 7px;
  border-radius: 5px;
  background: var(--lime-soft);
  border: 1px solid rgba(183, 255, 60, 0.18);
}

input[type="range"] {
  -webkit-appearance: none;
  appearance: none;
  width: 100%;
  height: 4px;
  border-radius: 99px;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--lime-dim) 0%, var(--lime-dim) var(--fill, 50%), #1d3033 var(--fill, 50%), #1d3033 100%);
  outline: none;
  cursor: pointer;
  display: block;
}
input[type="range"]::-webkit-slider-thumb {
  -webkit-appearance: none;
  width: 15px;
  height: 15px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #eaffc4;
  border: 2px solid #0a1214;
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--lime), 0 0 16px rgba(183, 255, 60, 0.4);
  transition: transform 120ms ease;
}
input[type="range"]::-moz-range-thumb {
  width: 13px;
  height: 13px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #eaffc4;
  border: 2px solid #0a1214;
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--lime), 0 0 16px rgba(183, 255, 60, 0.4);
}
input[type="range"]:active::-webkit-slider-thumb { transform: scale(1.15); }
input[type="range"]:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--cyan); outline-offset: 5px; border-radius: 99px; }
.range-scale { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 7px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 9px; color: #435755; }

.actions { display: flex; gap: 9px; padding: 3px 18px 0; }
.actions .btn-primary { flex: 1; }
.actions .btn-icon { border-color: var(--line-2); }

.kbd-hint {
  margin: 12px 18px 0;
  color: #4b605e;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 9.5px;
  letter-spacing: 0.03em;
}
kbd {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 1px 4px;
  border: 1px solid #263c3f;
  border-bottom-width: 2px;
  border-radius: 4px;
  background: #0b1416;
  color: #78908d;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 9px;
}

/* ---------- queue ---------- */

.queue-list {
  list-style: none;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0 12px 12px;
  max-height: 320px;
  overflow: auto;
  scrollbar-width: thin;
  scrollbar-color: #2a4043 transparent;
}
.queue-list::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; }
.queue-list::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #2a4043; border-radius: 99px; }

.queue-item {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 28px minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
  gap: 10px;
  align-items: start;
  padding: 10px 8px;
  border-radius: 10px;
  transition: background 140ms ease;
}
.queue-item + .queue-item { border-top: 1px solid rgba(26, 43, 46, 0.6); border-radius: 0; }
.queue-item:hover { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.022); }

.queue-index {
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  width: 26px;
  height: 26px;
  margin-top: 1px;
  border-radius: 7px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line-2);
  background: #0a1315;
  color: var(--dim);
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 9.5px;
}
.queue-item.is-active .queue-index { color: var(--lime); border-color: rgba(183, 255, 60, 0.35); background: var(--lime-soft); }

.queue-body { min-width: 0; }
.queue-url {
  display: block;
  color: #d7e7e3;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  white-space: nowrap;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  text-decoration: none;
  cursor: default;
}
.queue-url b { color: var(--dim); font-weight: 400; }
.queue-meta { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-top: 4px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 9px; color: var(--dim); }
.queue-meta .rate { color: #7d938f; }
.queue-progress { height: 3px; border-radius: 99px; background: #152225; overflow: hidden; margin-top: 7px; }
.queue-progress span { display: block; height: 100%; width: 0; border-radius: 99px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--lime-dim), var(--lime)); transition: width 240ms linear; }

.queue-remove {
  width: 24px;
  height: 24px;
  margin-top: 1px;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  border: 0;
  border-radius: 6px;
  background: transparent;
  color: #4d6361;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: color 140ms ease, background 140ms ease;
}
.queue-remove:hover { color: var(--red); background: rgba(255, 100, 120, 0.09); }
.queue-remove svg { width: 12px; height: 12px; }

.empty {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 16px 18px 22px;
  color: var(--dim);
  font-size: 11.5px;
  text-align: center;
}

/* ---------- stats ---------- */

.stats {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 18px;
}

.stat {
  position: relative;
  padding: 15px 16px 14px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 14px;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(17, 28, 30, 0.9), rgba(9, 15, 17, 0.92));
  overflow: hidden;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow);
}
.stat::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  right: -30px;
  bottom: -40px;
  width: 110px;
  height: 110px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(183, 255, 60, 0.08), transparent 70%);
  pointer-events: none;
}
.stat-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
.stat-top > span:first-child {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 9px;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  white-space: nowrap;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
}
.stat-mark { color: #2a4144; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }
.stat-value { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 6px; margin-top: 10px; }
.stat-value > span {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: clamp(21px, 2vw, 27px);
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: -0.045em;
  line-height: 1;
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}
.stat-value small { color: var(--dim); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 400; }
.stat-sub { margin: 9px 0 0; color: var(--dim); font-size: 10px; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }

.meter { height: 3px; margin-top: 11px; border-radius: 99px; background: #152225; overflow: hidden; }
.meter span { display: block; width: 0; height: 100%; border-radius: 99px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--lime-dim), var(--lime)); box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(183, 255, 60, 0.35); transition: width 220ms linear; }

/* ---------- mesh / chart ---------- */

.canvas-wrap { position: relative; margin: 0 12px 12px; border-radius: 11px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid rgba(26, 43, 46, 0.7); background: #060c0e; }
.mesh-wrap { height: 258px; }
.chart-wrap { height: 176px; }
.canvas-wrap canvas { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; }

.canvas-empty {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 6px;
  color: var(--dim);
  background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 45%, rgba(10, 18, 20, 0.5), rgba(6, 12, 14, 0.88));
  transition: opacity 300ms ease;
  pointer-events: none;
}
.canvas-empty.is-hidden { opacity: 0; }
.canvas-empty p { margin: 0; font-size: 11px; }
.empty-glyph { font-size: 26px; color: #334b4e; line-height: 1; }

.live-pill {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 7px;
  padding: 4px 9px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line-2);
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
  color: var(--dim);
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 9.5px;
  letter-spacing: 0.11em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}
.live-pill.is-live { color: var(--lime); border-color: rgba(183, 255, 60, 0.28); background: var(--lime-soft); }
.live-pill.is-paused { color: var(--amber); border-color: rgba(255, 200, 87, 0.3); background: rgba(255, 200, 87, 0.07); }
.live-pill.is-done { color: var(--cyan); border-color: rgba(69, 230, 255, 0.3); background: var(--cyan-soft); }

.legend {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 15px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  padding: 0 18px 14px;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 9px;
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  color: var(--dim);
}
.legend span { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
.swatch { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 2px; display: inline-block; }
.swatch-hub { background: var(--lime); box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(183, 255, 60, 0.6); }
.swatch-relay { background: var(--cyan); box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(69, 230, 255, 0.5); }
.swatch-target { border: 1px solid #6d8b88; background: transparent; }
.swatch-packet { border-radius: 50%; background: #eaffc4; box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--lime); }
.legend-note { margin-left: auto; color: #3f5654; }

.chart-meta { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; color: var(--dim); white-space: nowrap; }

/* ---------- log ---------- */

.log-tools { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
.log-list {
  list-style: none;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0 18px 14px;
  height: 212px;
  overflow: auto;
  scrollbar-width: thin;
  scrollbar-color: #2a4043 transparent;
}
.log-list::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; }
.log-list::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #2a4043; border-radius: 99px; }

.log-item {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 62px 14px minmax(0, 1fr);
  gap: 9px;
  align-items: baseline;
  padding: 6px 0;
  border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(26, 43, 46, 0.55);
  font-size: 11px;
  animation: log-in 220ms ease both;
}
.log-item:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
@keyframes log-in {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-4px); }
  to { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
}
.log-time { color: #4f6765; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 9.5px; }
.log-dot { display: grid; place-items: center; color: var(--lime); font-size: 9px; line-height: 1; }
.log-item.is-warn .log-dot { color: var(--amber); }
.log-item.is-block .log-dot { color: var(--red); }
.log-item.is-info .log-dot { color: var(--cyan); }
.log-text { color: #a9bebb; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10.5px; }
.log-item.is-warn .log-text { color: #cbb47f; }
.log-item.is-block .log-text { color: #c9909a; }
.log-item.is-info .log-text { color: #8fb7bd; }

/* ---------- footer ---------- */

.footer {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 20px;
  padding: 26px 2px 0;
  margin-top: 22px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  color: var(--dim);
  font-size: 10.5px;
}
.footer p { margin: 0; max-width: 640px; }
.footer strong { color: #8fa7a3; }
.footer code { color: #6c8582; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 9.5px; }
.footer-meta { text-align: right; }

/* ---------- toasts ---------- */

.toasts {
  position: fixed;
  right: 20px;
  bottom: 20px;
  z-index: 80;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 9px;
  pointer-events: none;
}
.toast {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  min-width: 230px;
  max-width: 360px;
  padding: 11px 14px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(183, 255, 60, 0.30);
  border-radius: 10px;
  background: rgba(11, 20, 22, 0.97);
  box-shadow: 0 18px 40px -16px #000;
  color: #d6e7e3;
  font-size: 11.5px;
  animation: toast-in 220ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.9, 0.3, 1.2) both;
}
.toast::before { content: "✓"; color: var(--lime); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; }
.toast.is-warn { border-color: rgba(255, 200, 87, 0.4); }
.toast.is-warn::before { content: "!"; color: var(--amber); }
.toast.is-error { border-color: rgba(255, 100, 120, 0.4); }
.toast.is-error::before { content: "×"; color: var(--red); }
.toast.is-out { animation: toast-out 180ms ease forwards; }
@keyframes toast-in { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px) scale(0.98); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }
@keyframes toast-out { to { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(5px) scale(0.98); } }

/* ---------- scan dialog ---------- */

.scan {
  width: min(780px, calc(100vw - 36px));
  max-height: min(86vh, 900px);
  padding: 0;
  border: 1px solid var(--line-2);
  border-radius: 16px;
  background: #0a1315;
  color: var(--text);
  box-shadow: 0 40px 120px -30px #000;
  overflow: auto;
  scrollbar-width: thin;
  scrollbar-color: #2a4043 transparent;
}
.scan::backdrop { background: rgba(2, 5, 6, 0.78); backdrop-filter: blur(6px); }
.scan[open] { animation: dialog-in 180ms ease both; }
@keyframes dialog-in { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px) scale(0.99); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }

.scan-head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 20px;
  padding: 22px 24px 16px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
}
.eyebrow {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 9px;
  letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--lime);
}
.scan-head h2 { margin: 6px 0 0; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }

.verdict {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 14px;
  margin: 18px 24px;
  padding: 12px 14px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 100, 120, 0.25);
  border-radius: 10px;
  background: rgba(255, 100, 120, 0.06);
}
.verdict-badge {
  flex: none;
  padding: 4px 9px;
  border-radius: 5px;
  background: rgba(255, 100, 120, 0.16);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 100, 120, 0.35);
  color: #ff9caa;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 9.5px;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}
.verdict p { margin: 0; color: #c7a7ac; font-size: 11.5px; }

.scan-table-wrap { margin: 0 24px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; overflow: auto; }
.scan-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 11px; min-width: 620px; }
.scan-table th {
  text-align: left;
  padding: 9px 12px;
  background: #0d181a;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  color: var(--dim);
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 9px;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  font-weight: 500;
}
.scan-table td { padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(26, 43, 46, 0.6); color: #a6bbb7; vertical-align: top; }
.scan-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 0; }
.scan-table td:first-child { white-space: nowrap; }
.scan-table code { color: #d9e9e4; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; }
.risk {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 2px 6px;
  border-radius: 4px;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 8.5px;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.risk-high { color: #ff9caa; background: rgba(255, 100, 120, 0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 100, 120, 0.22); }
.risk-mid { color: #e8c47d; background: rgba(255, 200, 87, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 200, 87, 0.2); }
.risk-low { color: #8fa8a4; background: rgba(120, 160, 155, 0.07); border: 1px solid rgba(120, 160, 155, 0.18); }

.scan-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 24px; padding: 18px 24px 0; }
.scan-grid h3 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #a9c0bc; }
.scan-grid p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 11.5px; line-height: 1.6; }

.hash-block { margin: 18px 24px 0; padding: 11px 13px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 9px; background: #081012; }
.hash-head { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 7px; color: var(--dim); font-size: 9.5px; font-family: var(--mono); }
.hash { display: block; color: #6f8986; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 9.5px; word-break: break-all; line-height: 1.45; }

.scan-foot {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 20px;
  margin-top: 20px;
  padding: 16px 24px 22px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
}
.scan-foot p { margin: 0; color: var(--dim); font-size: 10.5px; max-width: 460px; }

/* ---------- responsive ---------- */

@media (max-width: 1180px) {
  .dashboard { grid-template-columns: 340px minmax(0, 1fr); }
  .stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
}

@media (max-width: 960px) {
  .shell { width: calc(100% - 32px); }
  .dashboard { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .side { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; align-items: start; }
  .side .controls { grid-row: span 2; }
  .queue-list { max-height: 276px; }
  .mesh-wrap { height: 280px; }
}

@media (max-width: 720px) {
  .side { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .side .controls { grid-row: auto; }
  .notice { align-items: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .notice-copy { flex-basis: calc(100% - 50px); }
  .notice .btn { margin-left: 42px; }
  .topbar-inner { height: 62px; }
  .brand-copy small { display: none; }
  .pill-safe { padding: 6px 9px; font-size: 9px; }
  .btn-ghost span { display: none; }
  .stats { gap: 12px; }
  .stat { padding: 13px; }
  .stat-value > span { font-size: 20px; }
  .footer { flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
  .footer-meta { text-align: left; }
  .scan-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 14px; }
  .scan-foot { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
  .log-list { height: 190px; }
  .mesh-wrap { height: 236px; }
}

@media (max-width: 460px) {
  .shell { width: calc(100% - 24px); }
  .topbar-right .pill { display: none; }
  .stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .field-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .field-grid .field:first-child { padding-right: 18px; }
  .field-grid .field:last-child { padding-left: 18px; }
  .legend-note { display: none !important; }
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  *, *::before, *::after { animation-duration: 0.001ms !important; animation-iteration-count: 1 !important; transition-duration: 0.001ms !important; }
  html { scroll-behavior: auto; }
}

content.text:
Now app.js. Careful, thorough. Let's write.

Structure:

```js
(() => {
  'use strict';
  const $ = (sel, root=document) => root.querySelector(sel);
  ...
```

Elements.

Settings load/save:
```js
const STORAGE_KEY = 'clicklab.v1';
const defaults = { target: 240, payout: 4, relays: 8, speed: 2, queue: [...] };
```
Queue items: `{id, url}`. Generate ID.

State: delivered, credited, blocked, earnings, elapsed, quotas.

Need per-link clicks. `queue` items include `clicks`, `quota` runtime only (not persisted? persist URL only).

Render queue:
- for each item, create li with index, body (url split into host bold part? The url display: `<b>adf.ly</b>/demo/launch-notes`). Use URL parsing to get host + path. Set textContent to avoid injection. Build spans.
- meta: rate `$4.00 / 1k` + `<span class="link-clicks">0 / 0</span>`
- progress bar span.
- remove button svg.
- store refs in `queueRefs` map keyed id: {li, bar, clicks}
- attach remove handler via event delegation on list instead.

Event delegation on queueList click for `.queue-remove`.

`renderQueue()` also updates `queueCount` text, empty hidden, modeTag etc. On running, disable remove buttons (`disabled` attr) and add button.

Wait, if `started`, remove disabled. Use `updateRemoveState`.

`updateQueueProgress()`:
```js
queue.forEach(q => {
  const ref = queueRefs.get(q.id);
  if (!ref) return;
  const pct = q.quota ? Math.min(100, q.clicks / q.quota * 100) : 0;
  ref.bar.style.width = pct + '%';
  ref.clicks.textContent = `${q.clicks} / ${q.quota}`;
  ref.li.classList.toggle('is-active', state.running && !state.complete && q.clicks < q.quota);
});
```
When idle quota 0, show `—`? Display `0 / —` weird. Use `q.quota ? `${q.clicks} / ${q.quota}` : `${q.clicks} clicks``. Initially 0 clicks. Good.

Stats update:
- statClicks text = delivered.toLocaleString()
- statTarget = `/ ${state.target.toLocaleString()}`
- meter width = delivered/target
- viewsSub: idle "Campaign has not started"; running `${pct}% of target`; paused "Paused at X%"; complete "Target reached · X credited"; 
- earnings `$` + earnings.toFixed(3). At high earnings maybe 4 decimals? Use `formatMoney`: if < 1000, toFixed(3); Use `Intl.NumberFormat('en-US',{style:'currency',currency:'USD',minimumFractionDigits:3,maximumFractionDigits:3})`. $1.008.
- earningsSub: `$${payout.toFixed(2)} per 1,000 credited views` or `$0.0040 per credited view`? Use per 1k.
- statSuccess: success attempts: credited/delivered*100 with 1 decimal + `%`. If no delivered "—".
- statBlocked `${blocked} blocked` (view checks).
- statRelays = relays; statTime `Run time mm:ss`.
- chartMeta maybe in chart draw.

Start/pause/reset logic with button.

Button markup: startBtn has svg + span. I'll update inner label but icon should change to pause. We can replace svg path via innerHTML? Simplify: `startLabel` text and startBtn class; set icon element's path d. Use two SVG paths defined in JS? Better markup includes play icon; when running change to pause bars by setting `svg.innerHTML = '<path d="M5 3h2.2v10H5zM8.8 3H11v10H8.8z" fill="currentColor"/>'`. When paused/resume → play. When running → label "Pause campaign", icon pause. When paused → "Resume campaign". When complete → "Run again". When idle → "Start campaign". This is fine.

`updateUI()` calls stats + buttons + tag + mesh status.

Tag:
- idle: "idle" no class
- running: "live" class is-live
- paused: "paused" is-paused
- complete: "complete" is-done

meshStatus:
- standby / live / paused / complete; dot? live pill already has dot only in HTML initial; I'll set innerHTML with dot span. Use textContent for label? Build `<span class="dot"></span>${text}` via innerHTML each update; fine (static strings).
- meshEmpty hidden when started (running or paused or complete? Show if delivered===0 and not running. Hide when running. On reset show again.)
- meshStatus class.

`syncSettings` on inputs:
```js
targetInput.addEventListener('input', e => { if (!state.running) { state.target=clamp(parseInt...); settings.target=...; updateStats(); saveDebounced(); } else? }
```
While running, changing target could extend campaign. Simpler: disable target/payout/relays/speed? Speed and relays should be adjustable live (nice). Target/payout adjustable live too but complicated quotas. I'll allow: if user changes target while running, update state.target and recompute quotas? That's complexity. Better: disable target and payout while running; allow relays/speed live. Disable link add/remove while running. On pause still disabled. After complete re-enable.

Set `targetInput.disabled = state.running`, `payoutInput.disabled = state.running`, `linkInput.disabled`, `addLink.disabled`. Relays & speed stay enabled. Visually disabled inputs (opacity) via CSS? Add `input:disabled { opacity: .55; cursor: not-allowed }`. Add CSS later.

But `state.payout` used in earnings; read payout at start into state and keep. If not running, payout from input updates preview. At start read.

Relays: on input update state.relays and stat + save. Speed: update display and save. Both live.

On submit:
```js
campaignForm.addEventListener('submit', e => { e.preventDefault(); toggleCampaign(); });
```
Add link button type button.

`toggleCampaign()`:
```js
if (state.running && !state.paused) { pauseCampaign(); return; }
if (state.running && state.paused) { resumeCampaign(); return; }
beginCampaign();
```

begin:
```js
if (!queue.length) { toast('Add at least one link to the queue.', 'error'); return; }
const target = clamp(parseInt(targetInput.value,10)||0, 10, 10000);
const payout = clamp(parseFloat(payoutInput.value)||0, 0.1, 50);
state.target = target; state.payout=payout;
state.delivered=0; state.credited=0; state.blocked=0; state.earnings=0; state.acc=0; state.elapsed=0; state.complete=false;
state.running=true; state.paused=false;
state.startedAt = performance.now();
state.history = [{t:0, e:0}];
state.linkCursor=0;
const base = Math.floor(target / queue.length);
let rem = target % queue.length;
queue.forEach((q,i)=>{ q.clicks=0; q.quota = base + (i<rem?1:0); });
...
log(`campaign armed · ${target} views across ${queue.length} target${...}`, 'info');
log(`relay mesh online · ${state.relays} virtual exits`, 'info');
updateAll();
```
If target < queue length some quotas 0; the progress will show 0/0 and no clicks; fine, but maybe warn. Could enforce target >= queue.length*10. target min 10 and queue could be 12; some 0. Fine.

`step()` interval 200ms:
```js
if (!state.running || state.paused) return;
const speed = state.speed;
state.acc += state.relays * 1.15 * speed * 0.2;
let n = Math.floor(state.acc);
state.acc -= n;
if (n <= 0) { return; }
const remaining = state.target - state.delivered;
n = Math.min(n, remaining);
if (n <= 0) return;
let credited=0, blocked=0, earned=0;
for (i...) {
  const link = nextLink();
  if (!link) break;
  if (Math.random() < 0.925) { credited++; link.clicks++; state.credited++; state.earnings += state.payout/1000; }
  else { blocked++; state.blocked++; }
  state.delivered++;
}
state.elapsed += 0.2;
```
Hmm per-link clicks should include blocked attempts? For progress it's views delivered per link. Increment link.clicks for every attempt assigned, whether credited or blocked. Yes do link.clicks++ before success check. But then quota consumption matches. earnings on success only.

`nextLink()` returns link with clicks < quota, round robin.

Completion check after loop:
```js
if (state.delivered >= state.target) finishCampaign();
else updateStats...
```
But if n less than attempts because nextLink null (quotas exhausted) while delivered<target due to rounding? Sum quotas == target so fine.

History sampling: `state.historyAcc += 0.2; if (state.historyAcc >= 1) { history.push({t: state.elapsed, e: state.earnings}); historyAcc=0; trim; }`
Draw chart in rAF loop continuously, so fine.

Log sampling:
```js
state.logAcc += n;
if (state.logAcc >= 6) { state.logAcc = 0; sampleLog(); }
```
Events arrays with placeholders. Use random.

Sample messages:
- `relay-0X established circuit → target 0Y`
- `view credited · dwell 12.4s · +$0.0040`
- `target 0Y served · fingerprint accepted`
- blocked: `hold: duplicate fingerprint (simulated)` / `blocked: VPN exit flagged (simulated)` / `challenge timeout · retry dropped`
- info: `circuit rotated · new exit node`
- `payout ledger synced · $X.XXX`

Don't overclaim realism.

`finishCampaign()`:
```js
state.running=false; state.paused=false; state.complete=true;
state.elapsed = Math.max(state.elapsed, 0.1);
// fill history final point
state.history.push({t: state.elapsed, e: state.earnings});
log(`campaign complete · ${state.credited} credited / ${state.blocked} blocked · $...`, 'info');
toast(`Simulation complete — ${state.credited} credited views.`);
updateAll();
```

Reset:
```js
state.running=false; state.paused=false; state.complete=false; zeros; queue clicks=0 quota=0; log reset?
log('simulation reset', 'info'); clear history; updateAll();
```
Should clear log? Keep and add reset line. Clear log button separately. Reset maybe clears log then adds one line? I'd keep log for history. Maybe reset stats and log `simulation reset · counters cleared`. Fine.

Pause: `state.paused = true; log('campaign paused by operator','warn'); updateAll();`
Resume: `state.paused=false; log(...)`.

Note elapsed doesn't advance while paused since step returns. Good.

Log function:
```js
function log(text, kind='ok') {
  const li = document.createElement('li');
  li.className = `log-item is-${kind}`; // ok default needs no class? use is-ok; CSS only styles warn/block/info, is-ok lime default.
  const time = formatClock(state.elapsed);
  ...
  logList.prepend(li);
  while (children > 80) remove last
  logCount.textContent = `${n} events`; logEmpty.hidden = true;
}
```
append at top means newest first. Good.
Glyph per kind: ok "●", warn "▲", block "×", info "›". Wait grid column for dot 14px; use symbols.

When prepend and innerHTML? Use textContent for message to avoid injection (messages include URL? avoid queue URL in log; use indices). Fine.

Events count should count entries currently in list.

`clearLog`: empty list; count 0; empty shown.

Formatting clock: mm:ss from seconds.

Chart drawing:
Keep `history` array points {t,e}. In rAF drawChart. Use current elapsed? For smoothness just use points. If idle no history → draw placeholder grid + text "awaiting data"? The chart card header shows awaiting data. Canvas could draw flat zero line and faint label. Implement:
```js
function drawChart() {
  const {ctx,w,h} = setupCanvas(chartCanvas);
  ctx.clearRect...
  // padding left 44 right 12 top 12 bottom 20
  // grid 4 horizontal lines with $ labels based on maxE
  // if points<2: show baseline dashed and text 'no campaign data'
  // x scale by time: t from max(0, lastT-60) to max(60,lastT)? Simpler last 60 seconds window. If run <60, x domain 0..60. This shows growth slowly. Better domain 0..max(30,lastT) to fill.
```
Use domain t: 0..Math.max(30, last.t). If long run, 60s window ending at last.t: start = Math.max(0, last.t-60); x domain end = max(last.t, start+30). Hmm simpler: show entire run up to 120s, then sliding 120s. For typical 15s run, chart x 0..max(10,last.t). Use y max = max(0.01, overall max earnings *1.15).

Area gradient lime. Line. Dot at end. Labels: bottom start/end times, y labels `$0`, `$max/2`, `$max`.

Use DPR scaling helper:
```js
function fitCanvas(canvas) {
  const dpr = Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio||1, 2);
  const rect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();
  const w = Math.max(1, Math.round(rect.width*dpr)), h=...
  if (canvas.width!==w||canvas.height!==h){canvas.width=w;canvas.height=h;}
  const ctx=canvas.getContext('2d'); ctx.setTransform(dpr,0,0,dpr,0,0);
  return {ctx,w:rect.width,h:rect.height};
}
```
Using rect each frame triggers layout? getBoundingClientRect per frame okay but can be costly. Cache size with ResizeObserver. Simpler: fit on resize and read `canvas.clientWidth`. Use function each draw reading clientWidth/clientHeight; fine for 2 canvases.

Mesh:
- nodes computed based on w/h; relay count state.relays could be up to 24; drawing 24 nodes around center plus targets = 48; okay but cluttered. Display min(relays, 12)? The "relay fleet" number 8; mesh visual can show up to 12. But if user sets 24, showing 24 small dots is fine. Use `shownRelays = Math.min(state.relays, 16)`.
- Angles: relay i angle = -PI/2 + i*2PI/n + rotation*0.15; target i angle offset + half step at outer radius.
- Radius rx = min(w,h)*0.30, ry = min(w,h)*0.34? Ellipse to fit wide. Use r = min(w,h)*0.28 for relays and 0.43 for targets. Center.
- Packets: `packets[]` with relay index, target index (same i), t (0..1), speed (0.7–1.4), kind success/block, phase? Position:
  - first half: center → relay (t<0.5): p = lerp(center, relay, ease(t/0.5))
  - second: relay → target (t>=0.5): lerp(relay,target,ease((t-0.5)/0.5))
- Spawn: `if (state.running && !state.paused) spawnAcc += dt * (state.relays*0.35*state.speed); while(spawnAcc>1) spawn`. But animation frame dt unknown; use performance.now diff capped 0.05.
- Draw packets as circles with shadowBlur; failure red.
- Also draw connection lines center→relay→target faintly.
- Draw rotating dashed rings.
- Draw center hub: circle with lime stroke, hexagon? A circle radius 18 with glow, plus inner lightning? Use text "HUB" below. Draw a small diamond.
- Draw relay nodes: circle radius 3.5 cyan, glow; labels `R1` in 8px mono if n <= 12 maybe; always small.
- Target nodes: small square 3px outline grey; labels `T1` maybe skip.
- Add HUD text top-left inside canvas: `EXIT MESH · ${relays} NODES` and top-right `SIMULATED` faint; but headers already. Maybe draw subtle coordinate ticks and corner brackets — aesthetic.
- Idle: still draw nodes, no packets. show overlay canvas-empty only when no campaign.

Reduced motion: check media query; if reduced, draw static and spawn no packets? Keep packets but fewer? Set `const reduceMotion = matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;` and if true, no packet animation, just static draw. But rAF loop still. Fine.

Chart updates continuous.

Resize: rAF loop handles size each draw; okay.

Event listeners:
- openScan buttons → dialog.showModal() with fallback (if showModal not exist, set open attr).
- closeScan, scanDone → close.
- copyHashes → navigator.clipboard.writeText(list).then(toast). Include all 3 hashes? Build string. Add all file hashes? We know: BotOpener, ADFly, termdd, objects.list, README, LICENSE. Copy files + hashes. Use clipboard fallback with document.execCommand? Keep simple with try/catch.
- dialog click on backdrop: if e.target === dialog → close.
- keyboard: Space toggles if target not input/button/textarea/select and dialog not open; prevent default; R resets (with no modifier). '?' opens scan.
- Clear log.
- remove queue: event delegation.
